:"She is well educated, well-behaved, and well-liked by the elves."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, she hates humans because they pollute nature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She avoids contact with people and does not like to be seen."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c96687"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルフの姫騎士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強く凛々しく勇敢、プライドが高い努力家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界のために剣をとり戦う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道、品行方正でエルフたちからも慕われていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、人間は自然を汚すものとして嫌っている。人との接触は避け、姿を見られるのも嫌がる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23427","sourceWorkId":"30868","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルフの姫騎士。気が強く凛々しく勇敢、プライドが高い努力家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界のために剣をとり戦う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道、品行方正でエルフたちからも慕われていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、人間は自然を汚すものとして嫌っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人との接触は避け、姿を見られるのも嫌がる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94401"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c3e06071795f53911e3f6fa305b0db02d3f22c8f0c972bff46882af757fc353.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f444409fbc9982cab5569478fef6901dac1d1d661a5a76daf414083f96e229f2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:332670:94401:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c96688","characterName":"リザ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94402","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"332670"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23428"],"vndbCharacterId":"c96688"},"originalCharacterName":"リザ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate",